ps://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/deployments","created_at":"2012-10-22T08:20:41Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T23:43:45Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-09T02:07:49Z","git_url":"git://github.com/axboe/fio.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:axboe/fio.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/axboe/fio.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/axboe/fio","homepage":null,"size":30846,"stargazers_count":5981,"watchers_count":5981,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1356,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":234,"license":{"key":"gpl-2.0","name":"GNU General Public License v2.0","spdx_id":"GPL-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/gpl-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTg="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1356,"open_issues":234,"watchers":5981,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/pulls/309","html_url":"https://github.com/axboe/fio/pull/309","diff_url":"https://github.com/axboe/fio/pull/309.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/axboe/fio/pull/309.patch","merged_at":"2017-02-13T15:39:39Z"},"body":"macOS 10.12 introduced support for clock_gettime() but when compiling\r\nwith Xcode 8 (or later) and targeting 10.11 (or older) the clock_gettime\r\nsymbol is now found at configure/compile time but referenced weakly.\r\nRunning the created binary on 10.11 results in a \"dyld: lazy symbol\r\nbinding failed: Symbol not found: _clock_gettime\" error.\r\n\r\nThis drama has played out across other projects:\r\n- https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/issues/2674\r\n- https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/1069\r\n- https://svn.filezilla-project.org/filezilla?view=revision&revision=7824OO\r\n- https://github.com/mesonbuild/meson/pull/949\r\n- https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&q=label%3Aclock_gettime%20\r\n\r\nOptions for working around this issue include:\r\n1. Turn references to functions that might be weak into compilation\r\n   errors (-Werror=partial-availability).\r\n2. Disable visibility of functions that might be weak at compile link\r\n   time (-Wl,-no_weak_imports).\r\n3. Change configure tests to directly check the targeted OSX version and\r\n   fail the test if it is too old to have the required function.\r\n4. Make an empty function declaration marked with\r\n   __attribute__((weak_import)) that is used if the symbol would\r\n   otherwise be unavailable. It is then possible to check if the symbol\r\n   is NULL at runtime to determine availability.\r\n\r\nThis commit does 2. when targeting the Darwin platform after checking if\r\nthe compiler/linker work with that option. It also changes the clockid_t\r\nconfigure test to no longer use clock_gettime() because targeting OSX\r\n10.11 when using the 10.12 SDK results in having the clockid_t typedef\r\nwithout having the clock_gettime function. The combination of these\r\nfixes should solve https://github.com/axboe/fio/issues/305 .\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Sitsofe Wheeler <sitsofe@yahoo.com>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/issues/309/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/fio/issues/309/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"icculus","id":673562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzU2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/673562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus","html_url":"https://github.com/icculus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icculus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at